{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":48,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"A Song. A Psalm by the sons of Korah."},{"n":1,"text":"Great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised, in the city of our God, in his holy mountain.","tok":[{"t":"Great "},{"t":"is","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" greatly "},{"t":"to","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" praised, "},{"t":"in","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" city "},{"t":"of","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" our God, "},{"t":"in","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H7141"]},{"t":" holy mountain."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Beautiful in elevation, the joy of the whole earth, is Mount Zion, on the north sides, the city of the great King.","tok":[{"t":"Beautiful "},{"t":"in","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" elevation, "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" joy "},{"t":"of","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" whole earth, "},{"t":"is","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Mount","s":["H2022"],"a":[5]},{"t":" Zion, "},{"t":"on","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" north sides, "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"]},{"t":" King."}]},{"n":3,"text":"God has shown himself in her citadels as a refuge.","tok":[{"t":"God "},{"t":"has","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" shown himself "},{"t":"in","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"her","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" citadels "},{"t":"as","s":["H3303"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" refuge."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For, behold, the kings assembled themselves, they passed by together.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H3045"]},{"t":", behold, "},{"t":"the","s":["H3045"]},{"t":" kings assembled "},{"t":"themselves","s":["H3045"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"they","s":["H3045"]},{"t":" passed by together."}]},{"n":5,"text":"They saw it, then they were amazed. They were dismayed. They hurried away.","tok":[{"t":"They","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"saw","s":["H2009"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"it","s":["H3588"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"then","s":["H2009"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"they","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"were","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" amazed. "},{"t":"They","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"were","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" dismayed. "},{"t":"They","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" hurried "},{"t":"away","s":["H5674"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Trembling took hold of them there, pain, as of a woman in travail.","tok":[{"t":"Trembling took hold "},{"t":"of","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"them","s":["H1992"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"there","s":["H1992"]},{"t":", pain, "},{"t":"as","s":["H3651"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" woman "},{"t":"in","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" travail."}]},{"n":7,"text":"With the east wind, you break the ships of Tarshish.","tok":[{"t":"With","s":["H8033"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3205"]},{"t":" east wind, "},{"t":"you","s":["H3205"]},{"t":" break "},{"t":"the","s":["H3205"]},{"t":" ships "},{"t":"of","s":["H3205"]},{"t":" Tarshish."}]},{"n":8,"text":"As we have heard, so we have seen, in the city of the LORD of Armies, in the city of our God. God will establish it forever. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"As "},{"t":"we","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" have heard, "},{"t":"so","s":["H7307"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"we","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" have seen, "},{"t":"in","s":["H7665"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7665"]},{"t":" city "},{"t":"of","s":["H7307"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7665"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H7307"]},{"t":" Armies, "},{"t":"in","s":["H7665"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7665"]},{"t":" city "},{"t":"of","s":["H7307"]},{"t":" our God. God "},{"t":"will","s":["H7307"]},{"t":" establish "},{"t":"it","s":["H7665"]},{"t":" forever. Selah."}]},{"n":9,"text":"We have thought about your loving kindness, God, in the middle of your temple.","tok":[{"t":"We","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" thought "},{"t":"about","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" loving kindness, "},{"t":"God","s":["H3068"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"in","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" middle "},{"t":"of","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" temple."}]},{"n":10,"text":"As is your name, God, so is your praise to the ends of the earth. Your right hand is full of righteousness.","tok":[{"t":"As","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" name, God, so "},{"t":"is","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" praise "},{"t":"to","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" ends "},{"t":"of","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" earth. "},{"t":"Your","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" right hand "},{"t":"is","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" full "},{"t":"of","s":["H7130"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H2617"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Let Mount Zion be glad! Let the daughters of Judah rejoice because of your judgments.","tok":[{"t":"Let","s":["H3651"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Mount","s":["H4390"]},{"t":" Zion "},{"t":"be","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" glad! "},{"t":"Let","s":["H3651"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" daughters "},{"t":"of","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" Judah rejoice "},{"t":"because","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" judgments."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Walk about Zion, and go around her. Number its towers.","tok":[{"t":"Walk "},{"t":"about","s":["H2022"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" go around "},{"t":"her","s":["H1323"]},{"t":". Number its towers."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Notice her bulwarks. Consider her palaces, that you may tell it to the next generation.","tok":[{"t":"Notice "},{"t":"her","s":["H5608"],"a":[6]},{"t":" bulwarks. Consider "},{"t":"her","s":["H5608"]},{"t":" palaces, that